Description: The piCurve package incorporates a pool of photosynthesis irradiance (PI) models, enabling researchers to analyze the intricate relationship between irradiance and photosynthesis. It provides a comprehensive framework to study the effects of different irradiance levels on photosynthetic activity across various plant species and environmental conditions.
